WEBVTT

00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:02.724
Grid Bot Builder. Grid Bot Blueprint.

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:05.612
Lesson three. What is a grid bot.

00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:10.394
Education only. Not financial advice. This

00:00:10.394 --> 00:00:12.673
is general information and doesn't

00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:15.029
consider your objectives, financial

00:00:15.029 --> 00:00:18.023
situation or needs. Crypto is high risk.

00:00:18.483 --> 00:00:21.471
You could lose all the money you put in. A

00:00:21.471 --> 00:00:23.695
grid bot, in this lesson, is not a guess

00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:26.242
about next month. It is a set of limit

00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:28.713
orders waiting on rungs inside a band you

00:00:28.713 --> 00:00:32.165
already measured. The band is the summer

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.922
of 2023. The path is already on the chart.

00:00:35.382 --> 00:00:37.660
We are naming the mechanism, not claiming

00:00:37.616 --> 00:00:40.628
a fill. By the end you will be able to do

00:00:40.628 --> 00:00:44.548
three things. Define a grid as limit

00:00:44.963 --> 00:00:52.228
orders waiting inside 24930 to 30331. Say

00:00:52.228 --> 00:00:55.657
which side of 27630 is the buy side in

00:00:55.657 --> 00:01:06.483
this picture. Refuse a sentence that calls

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:18.493
the ten crosses a result. A limit order

00:01:18.493 --> 00:01:20.740
waits at a price. A market order cuts

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:23.107
through the book. They are different

00:01:23.107 --> 00:01:27.665
tools. On this chart the middle rung is

00:01:27.665 --> 00:01:29.775
27630. The daily close crossed it ten

00:01:29.775 --> 00:01:32.332
times. Each cross is the path changing

00:01:32.332 --> 00:01:36.123
sides. It is not a receipt. One teaching

00:01:36.123 --> 00:01:38.650
picture places buy orders below the middle

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:43.692
and sell orders above it. Below 27630:

00:01:43.781 --> 00:01:54.657
26730, 25830, 24930. Above it: 28531,

00:01:54.914 --> 00:02:02.368
29431, 30331. When the path stepped down

00:02:02.368 --> 00:02:05.582
toward 26050 on 18 August 2023, it was on

00:02:05.582 --> 00:02:09.214
the lower side of that picture. When it

00:02:09.214 --> 00:02:12.737
later printed 27969 on 7 October, it was

00:02:12.737 --> 00:02:16.056
back through the middle. If the path

00:02:16.056 --> 00:02:18.172
leaves, one side can be left holding

00:02:18.172 --> 00:02:21.976
inventory. The October leave did that to

00:02:21.976 --> 00:02:26.148
any band that ended at 30331. The public

00:02:26.148 --> 00:02:28.798
path draws across this window. We stop on

00:02:28.798 --> 00:02:30.942
a handful of days, not on every print.

00:02:31.403 --> 00:02:33.956
Every close is an example. It is not a

00:02:33.956 --> 00:02:39.309
fill, and it is not a forecast. On 19 July

00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:43.325
2023, the public daily close was 29914.

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:49.984
That day's low was 29794 and the high was

00:02:49.984 --> 00:02:55.014
30184. The close is inside the band of

00:02:55.014 --> 00:03:02.231
24930 to 30331. On 8 August 2023, the

00:03:02.294 --> 00:03:06.119
public daily close was 29765. That day's

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:12.113
low was 29114 and the high was 30177. The

00:03:12.306 --> 00:03:18.257
close is inside the band of 24930 to

00:03:18.257 --> 00:03:25.147
30331. On 24 August 2023, the public daily

00:03:25.218 --> 00:03:30.091
close was 26162. That day's low was 25915

00:03:30.091 --> 00:03:35.395
and the high was 26555. The close is

00:03:35.948 --> 00:03:42.738
inside the band of 24930 to 30331. On 13

00:03:43.392 --> 00:03:47.992
September 2023, the public daily close was

00:03:47.992 --> 00:03:54.128
26228. That day's low was 25781 and the

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:59.354
high was 26376. The close is inside the

00:03:59.686 --> 00:04:06.352
band of 24930 to 30331. On 29 September

00:04:06.403 --> 00:04:10.141
2023, the public daily close was 26912.

00:04:10.601 --> 00:04:16.602
That day's low was 26722 and the high was

00:04:16.602 --> 00:04:22.492
27226. The close is inside the band of

00:04:22.492 --> 00:04:30.181
24930 to 30331. On 16 October 2023, the

00:04:30.207 --> 00:04:34.290
public daily close was 28519. That day's

00:04:34.302 --> 00:04:40.088
low was 27130 and the high was 29448. The

00:04:40.281 --> 00:04:46.232
close is inside the band of 24930 to

00:04:46.232 --> 00:04:51.922
30331. Worked check. Point at 27630. Say

00:04:51.922 --> 00:04:56.450
whether 26050 on 18 August is below it. It

00:04:56.450 --> 00:05:00.375
is. Recap. A grid here means limit orders

00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:10.273
waiting inside the measured band. Buys sit

00:05:10.273 --> 00:05:14.248
below 27630 in the picture. Sells sit

00:05:14.248 --> 00:05:22.500
above it. The October leave left that

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:34.453
picture behind. A crystal ball crossed out

00:05:34.453 --> 00:05:36.739
next to orders waiting on a ladder of

00:05:36.739 --> 00:05:39.025
prices: a grid bot doesn't predict, it

00:05:39.025 --> 00:05:44.207
waits. A simple robot next to a ladder of

00:05:44.207 --> 00:05:46.942
price lines with buy orders below and sell

00:05:46.942 --> 00:05:52.228
orders above. A chart box labelled with

00:05:52.228 --> 00:05:54.835
five words: top, bottom, price steps, what

00:05:54.835 --> 00:05:59.207
you hold, and stop. An order ticket

00:05:59.207 --> 00:06:01.374
waiting on a price line while the price

00:06:01.348 --> 00:06:06.892
moves toward it. Price drops down through

00:06:06.892 --> 00:06:09.059
a line, and the buy order waiting there

00:06:08.863 --> 00:06:14.069
gets filled. Price rises up through a

00:06:14.069 --> 00:06:16.182
line, and the sell order waiting there

00:06:16.072 --> 00:06:21.682
gets filled. Two jars showing that after

00:06:21.682 --> 00:06:24.028
buys you hold more of the coin and after

00:06:24.028 --> 00:06:29.681
sells you hold more cash. A robot putting

00:06:29.681 --> 00:06:32.130
order tickets back on a ladder: its job is

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:34.283
to keep your orders waiting at your

00:06:34.283 --> 00:06:40.040
prices. A notebook sketch with five labels

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.264
to point at: top, bottom, price steps,

00:06:42.264 --> 00:06:47.102
what you hold and stop. A pretend price

00:06:47.102 --> 00:06:49.431
line crossing several lines, with dots

00:06:49.431 --> 00:06:51.833
where orders would fill, marked Example.

00:06:53.676 --> 00:06:56.076
Orders filling on a sideways chart next to

00:06:56.076 --> 00:06:58.475
a crossed-out earnings meter: fills do not

00:06:58.475 --> 00:07:03.256
mean you made money. A crossed-out

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:05.476
handshake: this course has no partner

00:07:05.476 --> 00:07:09.942
company and works for no exchange. Four

00:07:09.942 --> 00:07:12.464
icons in a row: orders wait inside your

00:07:12.464 --> 00:07:14.986
range, the stop is written, and what you

00:07:14.986 --> 00:07:19.800
hold changes. A notebook sketch with the

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:21.863
five words labelled and one step down

00:07:21.863 --> 00:07:27.352
drawn. A notebook sketch with five empty

00:07:27.352 --> 00:07:29.673
tags for you to fill in and say out loud.

00:07:33.076 --> 00:07:35.411
A notebook sketch of an order waiting on a

00:07:35.291 --> 00:07:37.404
price line until the price reaches it.

00:07:40.896 --> 00:07:43.393
Three things crossed out: a grid bot is

00:07:43.393 --> 00:07:45.890
not a signal, not a fund, and not a person

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:51.353
watching for you. Your notebook with an

00:07:51.353 --> 00:07:53.631
arrow to the next lesson about the shapes

00:07:53.501 --> 00:07:59.542
price can make. Next lesson: Market

00:07:59.542 --> 00:08:01.877
regimes. Bring the page with the band, the

00:08:01.851 --> 00:08:04.631
gaps, and the stop sentence. Leave every

00:08:05.058 --> 00:08:07.225
figure marked Example. No order is sent

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:08.032
between lessons.

